      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\"The air is thick with silence, and the ground beneath your feet trembles
    with ancient power. You have walked through fire and shadow to reach this place,
    Warrior. Many have tried before you\u2026 none have returned. The first gate
    stands before you \u2014 crumbling, yet unbroken \u2014 whispering the names
    of those who dared and fell. But you are different. You can feel it. The journey
    ahead will test not just your blade, but your very soul. Steel yourself, for
    this is where your legend begins\u2026 Level One awaits.\""
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
